the character and you're playing as Ryan, people will still tell you about Ryan's

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.140
girlfriend to Ryan.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:24.640
Well, they didn't want to have two different...

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:31.040
Obviously, there's no, like, variable that tells you, like, oh, use this character name.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:32.240
It's just Ryan.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:33.660
